{% when "learn-pilates-101" %}
<p class="air-guide-intro">A Pilates reformer combines a sliding carriage, a frame and resistance. FLEX AIR uses mechanical springs.</p>
<h2>The reformer, explained.</h2>
<h3>The sliding carriage</h3><p>The cushioned platform travels along the rail. Its movement is controlled through the exercise and the configured spring resistance.</p>
<h3>Mechanical spring resistance</h3><p>Adjust the spring configuration manually according to the supplied instructions. The FLEX AIR app does not adjust the springs.</p>
<h3>Getting started at home</h3><p>Read the manual, inspect the setup and leave clear space around the reformer. Begin with guidance appropriate to your experience.</p>
