{% when "learn-reformer-benefits" %}
<p class="air-guide-intro">Reformer practice brings movement and resistance together. Choose exercises and guidance appropriate to your needs.</p>
<h2>Move with intention.</h2>
<h3>Control and coordination</h3><p>The moving carriage asks you to pay attention to the outward movement and the return. Focus on controlled execution rather than speed.</p>
<h3>A varied practice</h3><p>Explore movement with the carriage and spring resistance. Use the exercise guidance supplied for your equipment and ability.</p>
<h3>A routine of your own</h3><p>A home reformer gives you a place for practice. Your progress depends on your routine, technique and individual circumstances.</p>
