{% when "learn-buying-guides" %}
<p class="air-guide-intro">Check the equipment, dimensions and included kit before ordering.</p>
<h2>Is FLEX AIR right for your space?</h2>
<h3>Measure the room</h3><p>The FLEX AIR body is 1645 mm long, 616 mm wide and 439 mm high. Plan additional clearance for access and your full range of movement.</p>
<h3>Check the specifications</h3><p>Maximum load is 120 kg; net weight is 25 kg. The carriage travel is 840 mm. Review the current product page for finishes, included accessories and availability.</p>
<h3>Understand the resistance</h3><p>FLEX AIR uses manually configured mechanical springs. SENSOL FLEX provides guided classes; it does not motorise the reformer.</p>
<h3>Review delivery and aftercare</h3><p>Read the current shipping, return and warranty information before ordering. Contact us if you need help with a product question.</p>
